(6863143, 1033141, 77196, '<td valign="top">It needs cheering up. I like the shades of blue, but feel it may be a bit too dark (possibly my monitor).</td>', 'It needs cheering up. I like the shades of blue, but feel it may be a bit too dark (possibly my monitor).', '2012-09-13 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863144, 1033210, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept, and nicely executed. Love the brown tone on tone. The only thing that bothers me is that the shadow of the tea appears to go behind the cup. Perhaps beginning to pour out, or extending down into the cup would be better.</td>', 'Great concept, and nicely executed. Love the brown tone on tone. The only thing that bothers me is that the shadow of the tea appears to go behind the cup. Perhaps beginning to pour out, or extending down into the cup would be better.', '2012-09-13 21:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863147, 1033127, 77196, '<td valign="top">To me, this appears to be a cheerful image - love the little (and not so little) spots of bright color against the bland or black background.</td>', 'To me, this appears to be a cheerful image - love the little (and not so little) spots of bright color against the bland or black background.', '2012-09-13 21:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863148, 1033008, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is both a pleasing and bothering image - the highlights lighted only against a basically dark background, with a familiar swimming or diving pose is very pleasing. Not being able to figure out the size or the background is bothersome. Nice feel of motion to this.</td>', 'This is both a pleasing and bothering image - the highlights lighted only against a basically dark background, with a familiar swimming or diving pose is very pleasing. Not being able to figure out the size or the background is bothersome. Nice feel of motion to this.', '2012-09-13 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863151, 1032585, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not even going to try to guess how you did this. You definitely achieved a sense of depth - that the arc of ice comes out from the background towards you.</td>', 'Not even going to try to guess how you did this. You definitely achieved a sense of depth - that the arc of ice comes out from the background towards you.', '2012-09-13 21:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863153, 1033182, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on this.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on this.', '2012-09-13 21:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863154, 1033196, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion - like the grey against the green background, and the fore "frame" of non-grass.</td>', 'Great sense of motion - like the grey against the green background, and the fore "frame" of non-grass.', '2012-09-13 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863156, 1032918, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great feel of motion on this. Nice colors.</td>', 'Great feel of motion on this. Nice colors.', '2012-09-13 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863160, 1033212, 77196, '<td valign="top">Rent him out for movies! Nice capture of detail, and amazing that Buster doesn''t seem to have moved at all during your exposure.</td>', 'Rent him out for movies! Nice capture of detail, and amazing that Buster doesn''t seem to have moved at all during your exposure.', '2012-09-13 22:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863161, 1033203, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the skin tones, the dark background, and the nice color in the dress. The "motion" in this does not seem fluid, but does capture your interest.</td>', 'I like the skin tones, the dark background, and the nice color in the dress. The "motion" in this does not seem fluid, but does capture your interest.', '2012-09-13 22:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863162, 1032933, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing on this one. A bit abstract / over-textured, but still accessible image.</td>', 'Interesting processing on this one. A bit abstract / over-textured, but still accessible image.', '2012-09-13 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863164, 1033092, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great technique to use the motion of the clouds to create the illusion that the jet is moving - especially around the nose.</td>', 'Great technique to use the motion of the clouds to create the illusion that the jet is moving - especially around the nose.', '2012-09-13 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863165, 1033137, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the color, and sense of motion, combined with portions of the image that are in clear focus.</td>', 'Love the color, and sense of motion, combined with portions of the image that are in clear focus.', '2012-09-13 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863166, 1032426, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not enough here to be a recognizable entity, but enough to convey a grab, snatch, or quick touch. Nice contrast and composition.</td>', 'Not enough here to be a recognizable entity, but enough to convey a grab, snatch, or quick touch. Nice contrast and composition.', '2012-09-13 22:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863170, 1033230, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of motion to this, as well as use of the hanger as a "frame" for the plane.</td>', 'Nice feeling of motion to this, as well as use of the hanger as a "frame" for the plane.', '2012-09-13 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863171, 1033222, 77196, '<td valign="top">Fade to black? The low and orange-y light helps this shot, but for some reason the top of the picket fence adds a ton to this image.</td>', 'Fade to black? The low and orange-y light helps this shot, but for some reason the top of the picket fence adds a ton to this image.', '2012-09-13 22:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863173, 1033110, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting sense of motion in the bottom part, yet almost mountain steadfastness in the upper portion. Nice use of strong black / white with very little grey.</td>', 'Interesting sense of motion in the bottom part, yet almost mountain steadfastness in the upper portion. Nice use of strong black / white with very little grey.', '2012-09-13 22:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863175, 1033158, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh no! A moving dust mop! It seems like something strange is happening with the tile joints on the floor. If nothing else, they add an in-focus area to the shot as a contrast to the moving dog.</td>', 'Oh no! A moving dust mop! It seems like something strange is happening with the tile joints on the floor. If nothing else, they add an in-focus area to the shot as a contrast to the moving dog.', '2012-09-13 22:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863177, 1033223, 77196, '<td valign="top">Why is the goose swallowing the little person? A very abstract image with plenty of opportunity for imagination to discover seemingly familiar shapes.</td>', 'Why is the goose swallowing the little person? A very abstract image with plenty of opportunity for imagination to discover seemingly familiar shapes.', '2012-09-13 22:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863179, 1033136, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of lighting, blur, and composition that works for me. I can almost imagine a Chucky face balancing it on the right side.</td>', 'Interesting choice of lighting, blur, and composition that works for me. I can almost imagine a Chucky face balancing it on the right side.', '2012-09-13 22:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863182, 1033139, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - a bit of overexposure in spots, but that doesn''t ruin a very nice image.</td>', 'Nicely done - a bit of overexposure in spots, but that doesn''t ruin a very nice image.', '2012-09-13 22:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863183, 1033218, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very ghostly image - love the blank spot where the face is supposed to be, and the floating globe of light.</td>', 'Very ghostly image - love the blank spot where the face is supposed to be, and the floating globe of light.', '2012-09-13 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863184, 1033204, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the long streaks of light and great colors in this.</td>', 'Love the long streaks of light and great colors in this.', '2012-09-13 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863185, 1033034, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect - lengthening the arms.</td>', 'Interesting effect - lengthening the arms.', '2012-09-13 22:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863186, 1033112, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah, some personal interest in this shot - a younger lady, an older gentlemen chance to meet and talk. The background and clothes add a lot to this shot.</td>', 'Ah, some personal interest in this shot - a younger lady, an older gentlemen chance to meet and talk. The background and clothes add a lot to this shot.', '2012-09-13 22:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863187, 1033074, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I like that almost everything except the hand on the cursor pad is still.</td>', 'Nice capture. I like that almost everything except the hand on the cursor pad is still.', '2012-09-13 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863188, 1033176, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting distortion of the interior, combined with outside motion, and moving hand.</td>', 'Interesting distortion of the interior, combined with outside motion, and moving hand.', '2012-09-13 22:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863189, 1033124, 77196, '<td valign="top">I love the moving water contrasted with the stillness of the upper pool. The curve of the edge of the dam, and the colors in this are very, very nice.</td>', 'I love the moving water contrasted with the stillness of the upper pool. The curve of the edge of the dam, and the colors in this are very, very nice.', '2012-09-13 22:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863190, 1032953, 77196, '<td valign="top">You joust! Great feeling of motion / crash / speed - the moving horses/riders contrast with the still observers - like they''re holding their breath to see what the outcome will be.</td>', 'You joust! Great feeling of motion / crash / speed - the moving horses/riders contrast with the still observers - like they''re holding their breath to see what the outcome will be.', '2012-09-13 22:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863191, 1033174, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great motion and color - bit much foreground for my taste.</td>', 'Great motion and color - bit much foreground for my taste.', '2012-09-13 22:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863194, 1033198, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the person centered in the eye of the fire storm. Love the blown out area being limited to the circle, and, of course, the wonderful arcs of sparks.</td>', 'Love the person centered in the eye of the fire storm. Love the blown out area being limited to the circle, and, of course, the wonderful arcs of sparks.', '2012-09-13 22:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863195, 1033188, 77196, '<td valign="top">A Pixie dance! How delightful!</td>', 'A Pixie dance! How delightful!', '2012-09-13 22:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863196, 1033041, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great two-color image - love the contrast of the blue and orange/yellow. Lots of motion going on, but it almost looks like only the top of the image conveys any motion.</td>', 'Wow! Great two-color image - love the contrast of the blue and orange/yellow. Lots of motion going on, but it almost looks like only the top of the image conveys any motion.', '2012-09-13 22:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863197, 1033031, 77196, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this doesn''t work for me - I think I don''t see any pattern, meaning, or use for the red lighting paths around the top area of the bottle. It also looks like you did some patterns with white light that causes the hot highlights on the label, cap, and "shoulder" of the bottle. I do like the dark background, the red as a contrast. Just seems like someone playing with this &amp; that, rather than having a coherent idea of what they were looking for.</td>', 'For some reason, this doesn''t work for me - I think I don''t see any pattern, meaning, or use for the red lighting paths around the top area of the bottle. It also looks like you did some patterns with white light that causes the hot highlights on the label, cap, and "shoulder" of the bottle. I do like the dark background, the red as a contrast. Just seems like someone playing with this & that, rather than having a coherent idea of what they were looking for.', '2012-09-13 22:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863198, 1033232, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a spider, but I''m not sure I like the double-center, with one brighter than the other.</td>', 'Almost looks like a spider, but I''m not sure I like the double-center, with one brighter than the other.', '2012-09-13 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863199, 1033207, 77196, '<td valign="top">Talk about right angles! This is a strong image, yet restful. Looks like someone is laying down on the bench. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Talk about right angles! This is a strong image, yet restful. Looks like someone is laying down on the bench. Very nicely done.', '2012-09-13 22:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863200, 1033151, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. Love the contrast of red, white, and green. Tossed in the wind - nice bright image.</td>', 'Looks like a painting. Love the contrast of red, white, and green. Tossed in the wind - nice bright image.', '2012-09-13 22:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863202, 1033219, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Maybe sousaphones? Nice bright lines.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Maybe sousaphones? Nice bright lines.', '2012-09-13 22:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6863361, 1033176, 152546, '<td valign="top">I love the image and the crispness of the interior of the car.</td>', 'I love the image and the crispness of the interior of the car.', '2012-09-14 01:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
